{"root":{"data":{"id":"dlppwa6rdiw0","created":1790473533685,"text":"心血管药理"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlptv9z0z8o0","created":1790484739292,"text":"抗心律失常药\nAntiarrhythmic Drugs"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlptvezb00g0","created":1790484750193,"text":"心律失常发生的电生理机制"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlptvjnfwqw0","created":1790484760360,"text":"心律失常：心脏冲动、传导或者激动次序发生异常，\n引起心跳频率或节律发生紊乱"},"children":[]}]}]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}